      "message": "[error] Line 151: 🔴 `showNextScreen()` is executed immediately when `migration.isBeingDismissed` is true. That can start the next coordinator transition while modal dismissal is still in flight, which can lead to dropped/failed presentations (\"view is not in window hierarchy\") and inconsistent navigation state. Ensure the next state transition runs only after dismissal completes (e.g., always dismiss `migration` and call `showNextScreen` in the dismissal/transition completion).",
